' Notes
note top of programm : "Main Game Controller\nManages game state, monsters, heroes, and locations"
note top of hero : "Abstract base class for all playable characters\nOnly 4 actual hero implementations"
note top of monster : "Abstract base class for all enemy entities\nMonsters have AI behavior and frenzy states"
note top of location : "Represents game board locations\nContains items, NPCs, heroes, and monsters"
note top of perk : "Abstract base class for special abilities\nPerks provide strategic advantages to heroes"
note top of monster_card : "Abstract base class for monster action cards\nControls monster behavior and events\nMany classes I initially thought were heroes are actually monster cards!"

note right of map1 : "Enumeration of all game locations\nUsed for navigation and positioning"

@enduml 